    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Brain and Mind Institute is further ending the year on a positive note, as its founding director, \n       Prof Zul Merali , was appointed to the \n       World Dementia Council . He is among the nine new international leaders to join the council. The new council members come from different disciplines in the dementia field and are from Asia, Oceania, Europe, Africa, and the Americas. The BMI family is proud and delighted in this well-deserved recognition.",
